      "id": "wu-yang-pu-empress-wang-investiture",
      "title": "由德妃册立为皇后",
      "summary": "王氏原为杨溥德妃，大和五年九月册为皇后。《资治通鉴》记九月甲戌朔；本传称让皇后。",
      "year": 933,
      "sortOrder": 1,
      "precision": "day",
      "sourceDate": "吴大和五年九月甲戌朔；《十国春秋》作太和五年九月",
      "phase": "rule",
      "notes": [
        "确年为西历933年，原书大和／太和写法各保。未知名讳、子女及生卒，不据本传“不知所终”补出死亡事件。"
      ],
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "shiguochunqiu-v004",
          "paragraphId": "shiguochunqiu-v004-p5",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "2a17e82c6f9d9e3e482263fdb82bc48e94d04c013212edfb5ce41db7bd1ed10e",
          "excerpt": "讓皇后王氏，初事睿帝爲德妃，太和五年九月册立爲后。及南唐受禪，睿帝殂於丹楊官，后不知所終。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "tongjian-v278",
          "paragraphId": "tongjian-v278-p57",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "03a6a4e4faa7974abafd3a5ddc6b27c214e1ac23b32ef831f2af4a69d58b8267",
          "excerpt": "九月，甲戌朔，吳主立德妃王氏為皇后。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "shiguochunqiu-v003",
          "paragraphId": "shiguochunqiu-v003-p14",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "09f3830cdb96b79127113a0e84b1a6501ed01afa24997a3a298533aef256887d",
          "excerpt": "九月甲戌朔，立德妃王氏爲皇后。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
